KmX2afXdNX-SZQ0PgOQ3NwcM4f68s4Dm3N53X7mlwztZMTM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNkF1INPfRBHvqfQRPP-20b2zGlw0KEEJ-dCX3m6cu0rg&oe=6AE36B09"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "AstroCubeVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**AstroCubeVR** \u2014 immersive 3D exploration of astronomical datacubes, from Immersive Science.\n\nLoad FITS datacubes from ALMA and other radio telescopes and navigate through them in true 3D on Meta Quest.\n\n**Interactive measurement**\n- Measure distances directly in RA/Dec coordinates\n- Real-time coordinate display with velocity at each point\n- Automatic frequency-to-velocity conversion via Doppler formula\n- Labels render clearly on top of volume data\n\n**Multi-channel spectral lines**\n- Load and compare CO, HCN, HNC, and other molecular emissions side by side\n- Per-channel WCS from FITS headers\n- Velocity-normalized Z-axis aligns Doppler-shifted features across channels\n\n**Native FITS support**\n- Load .fits and .fits.gz cubes directly \u2014 no conversion needed\n- Full WCS header parsing with automatic voxel scaling\n- REST frequency detection from headers or ALMA-style filenames\n- ZIP support: download from Google Drive, extract and load automatically\n\n**Smart data handling**\n- Auto-optimizes oversized datasets to fit device memory\n- Gaussian filtering preserves visual detail during optimization\n- Progress feedback during loading \u2014 no frozen screens\n- Desktop version available at immsci.com/volumeVR for full-resolution work\n\n**Collaborate**\n- Share a virtual space with colleagues \u2014 explore the same datacube together in real time\n\n**Pre-loaded datasets**\n- Curated nebula observations ready to explore on launch\n\nStandalone on Meta Quest 2, Quest 3, and Quest Pro.\n", "short_description": "Explore 3D radio astronomy datacubes in VR. Load FITS files natively with full WCS coordinates, measure distances in RA/Dec, compare molecular emission channels side by side. Auto-optimizes large datasets. Built for radio astronomers. From Immersive Science, makers of StarGateVR.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.immsci.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Immersive Science LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.immsci.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9947701328641115"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1660600645254425"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1660600645254425"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1774629600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1660600645254425"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26556974623953857", "version": "4.0"}, "id": "1645121412836916", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9947701315307783", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26556974623953857"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1645121412836916"}]}, "change_log": "You can now read FITS files directly from a USB-C thumb drive inserted into the Quest headset.", "created_date": 1787445457, "id": "28098317899819514", "version": "4.0", "version_code": 397, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9947701315307783", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26556974623953857"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1645121412836916"}]}, "change_log": "File selection during file loading clarified.", "created_date": 1776210952, "id": "26556974623953857", "version": "4.0", "version_code": 359, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9947701315307783", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26556974623953857"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1645121412836916"}]}, "change_log": "AstroCubeVR has evolved into more than a data viewer \u2014 it's now a curated VR-based scientific publication. The app ships with a growing collection of ALMA and SMA radio observations of planetary nebulae, each with visualization presets tuned for the data and direct links to the peer-reviewed papers the data comes from.\n\nIncluded datasets\n\n\u2022 Planetary nebulae observed in multiple molecular tracers (CO, \u00b9\u00b3CO, C\u00b9\u2078O, CN, CS) from published ALMA surveys\n\u2022 Objects include Hb 5, NGC 2440, NGC 2818, NGC 2899, NGC 3132, NGC 6302, NGC 6445, and NGC 6720\n\u2022 Data from Moraga Baez et al. 2026, Kastner et al. 2025, and Kastner et al. 2024\n\nRecent improvements\n\n\u2022 ZIP file support \u2014 download compressed datasets from cloud storage, the app extracts automatically\n\u2022 Improved FITS compatibility for edge-case headers\n\u2022 Clearer loading feedback and improved default layout on first launch\n\nLearn more: www.immsci.com/home/astrocubevr/ (http://www.immsci.com/home/astrocubevr/)\nQuestions? Contact support@immsci.com\n", "created_date": 1774493976, "id": "26345095425141779", "version": "4.0", "version_code": 304, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9947701315307783", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26556974623953857"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1774476845, "id": "26342777758706879", "version": "4.0", "version_code": 302, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9947701315307783", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26556974623953857"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date":